{"about_the_game":"<strong>Mine gems, collect pickaxes, battle bosses, and explore treasure-filled biomes!</strong><br><br>Elevate your idle gaming experience with PickCrafter, now available on desktop! Smash blocks and reap the rewards in this captivating pixel-style clicker. Forge Legendary Pickaxes and gear to dominate the world of Runaria. <br><br>Prestige through Extravagant, Transcendent, Preposterous, and Legendary tiers. Craft intricate strategies with the new Ascension Skill Tree, and etch your name into the annals of legends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/a9ed9549aea1065a779015e2db1a97a6.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>Set forth on a journey to discover all the Biomes, from the snow-clad Tundra to the alien landscapes of the Moon and Mars. Unearth their mysteries and uncover hidden treasures!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/7bf97a98fae0f21fc68ef5e277ab1f61.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Unleash your inner strength with unlockable Abilities. Forge powerful equipment and supercharge your furnaces. Craft, upgrade, and dominate in PickCrafter!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/bbf2610117315ddd37bca0b6928af31e.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Challenge your friends, climb the leaderboards, and complete over 120 remarkable achievements. Rare, Epic, and Legendary items await you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/01507265b45439fe32cfd656af4e0102.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Download now and become the ultimate treasure hunter in this endlessly addictive adventure. Your fortune awaits!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/86fecb80aafaa301f5da0d5fbbfa65a0.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Join our Community Discord Server to suggest exciting new features and share your invaluable feedback!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b97e955f0c40b470bf0f4d8509dba0f578240ea7.jpg","localized_name":"Quarter Block","name":"Quarter Block","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/b97e955f0c40b470bf0f4d8509dba0f578240ea7.jpg"},{"icon":"91882cdc725e2ffe07284a3a0bb6a071101fd934.jpg","localized_name":"Backpack full of blocks","name":"Backpack full of blocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/91882cdc725e2ffe07284a3a0bb6a071101fd934.jpg"},{"icon":"9fc3907cda76831125b0019035e8f1e2a85471de.jpg","localized_name":"Room full of blocks","name":"Room full of blocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/9fc3907cda76831125b0019035e8f1e2a85471de.jpg"},{"icon":"51915ce35731486326c8203c4c11cc986b1d37d6.jpg","localized_name":"House full of blocks","name":"House full of blocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/51915ce35731486326c8203c4c11cc986b1d37d6.jpg"},{"icon":"df2042d8ee2e9b65efd1d9c9215b4c13343e7bb4.jpg","localized_name":"City full of blocks","name":"City full of blocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/df2042d8ee2e9b65efd1d9c9215b4c13343e7bb4.jpg"},{"icon":"a4260a70e5ec62861cbdc3b06340b6c1274937f0.jpg","localized_name":"World full of blocks","name":"World full of blocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/a4260a70e5ec62861cbdc3b06340b6c1274937f0.jpg"},{"icon":"fcc4d05c0b90b25efcbfc58dbe93be9689617fe1.jpg","localized_name":"Nose Picker","name":"Nose Picker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/fcc4d05c0b90b25efcbfc58dbe93be9689617fe1.jpg"},{"icon":"7ad7ad3a44f0af8832970eca5026aa6615ce46a2.jpg","localized_name":"Novice Picker","name":"Novice Picker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/7ad7ad3a44f0af8832970eca5026aa6615ce46a2.jpg"},{"icon":"63d67d4210edfd2be32be21ba203892e2b9f1773.jpg","localized_name":"Amateur Picker","name":"Amateur Picker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/63d67d4210edfd2be32be21ba203892e2b9f1773.jpg"},{"icon":"361041ed5956d71874a9cb55e4821d81ac91a323.jpg","localized_name":"Pro Picker","name":"Pro Picker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734750/361041ed5956d71874a9cb55e4821d81ac91a323.jpg"}],"total":121},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/734750?t=1772474111","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772474111","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772474111","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772474111","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Mine gems, collect pickaxes, battle bosses, and explore treasure-filled biomes!</strong><br><br>Elevate your idle gaming experience with PickCrafter, now available on desktop! Smash blocks and reap the rewards in this captivating pixel-style clicker. Forge Legendary Pickaxes and gear to dominate the world of Runaria. <br><br>Prestige through Extravagant, Transcendent, Preposterous, and Legendary tiers. Craft intricate strategies with the new Ascension Skill Tree, and etch your name into the annals of legends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/a9ed9549aea1065a779015e2db1a97a6.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>Set forth on a journey to discover all the Biomes, from the snow-clad Tundra to the alien landscapes of the Moon and Mars. Unearth their mysteries and uncover hidden treasures!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/7bf97a98fae0f21fc68ef5e277ab1f61.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Unleash your inner strength with unlockable Abilities. Forge powerful equipment and supercharge your furnaces. Craft, upgrade, and dominate in PickCrafter!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/bbf2610117315ddd37bca0b6928af31e.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Challenge your friends, climb the leaderboards, and complete over 120 remarkable achievements. Rare, Epic, and Legendary items await you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/01507265b45439fe32cfd656af4e0102.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Download now and become the ultimate treasure hunter in this endlessly addictive adventure. Your fortune awaits!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/extras/86fecb80aafaa301f5da0d5fbbfa65a0.avif?t=1772474111\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Join our Community Discord Server to suggest exciting new features and share your invaluable feedback!","developers":["Fiveamp"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734750/header.jpg?t=1772474111","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Fiveamp LLC. PickCrafter is a registered trademark of Fiveamp LLC in the U.S. and/or other countries (SN 86727321). All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.6<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/734750/134845/a2fe4a16c8bc868c0bf83df0f4096fa35d5bf9eb/1750576586/dash_av1.mpd?t=1699564092","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/734750/134845/a2fe4a16c8bc868c0bf83df0f4096fa35d5bf9eb/1750576586/dash_h264.mpd?t=1699564092","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/734750/134845/a2fe4a16c8bc868c0bf83df0f4096fa35d5bf9eb/1750576586/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1699564092","id":256701873,"name":"PickCrafter Steam Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256701873/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1699564092"}],"name":"PickCrafter","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cl